Third-party sources:
- Each seed file lists the sources it consulted in its "sources" array, with
  license notes. Anchors marked "embeddable": false (e.g. CEFR Companion
  Volume descriptors, English Profile EGP/EVP, Pearson GSE, MIT OCW, commercial
  textbooks) are cited by name/level/identifier only; no text from them is
  reproduced here.
- Lists such as NGSL/NAWL and Octanove C1/C2 are CC BY-SA 4.0; CEFR-J profiles
  (Tono Lab, TUFS) are free for research and commercial use with citation.

